    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ahaziya Omukama wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abasi ba Yerusaalemu, Ahaziya macura ga, Yehoraamu nuwe bateire ha ngoma ye; habwokuba, ekitebe ky'abasaija abaizire n'Abaharabu baaseesire orukande, abatabani abakuru boona, bakaba bamazire kubaita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahaziya mutabani w'omukama Yehoraamu, nukwo kuteera engoma. Ha yateeriire engoma, akaba ahikize omyaka abiri n'ebiri, akalemera omwaka gumu, omu rubuga Yerusaalemu. Ibara lya nyina, nuwe Asaliya, mwijukuru w'Omuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na uwe akakora nk'enju y'Ahabbu ebi yakozire, habwokuba nyina nuwe yamuhanurraga kukora ebibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akakora ebirukubiihiza MUKAMA, nk'enju y'Ahabbu oku yakozire; habwokuba ise obu yamazire kufa, abo nubo baabaire bahanuuzi be, abaamuhwerekeriize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaikiriza ebi baamuhanuliire, nukwo kugenda hamu na Yehoraamu mutabani w'Ahabbu omukama wa Isirairi kurwanisa Hazayeri omukama wa Siriya ow'akaba ali Ramosi-Giryadi. Abasiriya baahutaaza Yehoraamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagaruka Yezereeri, atambirwe ebihuta ebi baamuhutaaliize Raama, naarwanisa Hazayeri omukama wa Siriya. Ahaziya mutabani wa Yehoraamu, nukwo kugenda kumurora, habwokuba akaba ali murwaire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Ruhanga, nuwe yakitegekere kara, okufa kw'Ahaziya nkooku kulibaho, nikuraba omu kugenda kurora Yehoraamu. Habwokuba, obu yahikireyo, bakagenda hamu na Yehoraamu kwitirana Yehu mutabani wa Nimisi, MUKAMA ou kaba akomere, kuhwerekereza enju y'Ahabbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu obwakaba naacwera enju y'Ahabbu omusango, akaitirana abanyoro ba Yuda, na batabani b'abagenzi b'Ahaziya abaamuheerezaaga, yabaita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehu yaserra Ahaziya. Bakamukwata ayeserekere Samaliya, baamumuleetera yaitwa, Baamuziika, habwokuba bakateekereza bati, “Ogu nuwe mwijukuru wa Yehosafaati, ayakozire kyona ekiyasoboire kuheereza MUKAMA n'omutima gwe gwona.” Kandi omunju y'Ahaziya, hakaba hatarumu n'omu arukusobora kulya obukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omukamakati Asaliya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asaliya nyina Ahaziya obu yaboine mutabani we nkooku afiire, yaragira okuhwerekereza orulyo rw'obukama rwona orw'enju ya Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Yehosobyasi muhara w'omukama, akasereka Yowaasi mutabani w'Ahaziya, yamwiha omu batabani b'omukama abakaba bali haihi kwitwa, yamuta omu kisiika eky'okuraaramu, hamu n'omulezi we. Yehosabyasi muhara w'omukama Yehoraamu, kandi muka Yehoyaada nyakatagara, ow'akaba ali munyanya Ahaziya, nukwo ati yamutabwire Asaliya tiyamwita; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akasumi koona Asaliya aka yamazire naalema ensi egi, akaikara nabo okumara emyaka mukaaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
